#. adds several blank pages at once after the open page, which stays open.
#: rust/src/actions.rs
#, fuzzy
msgid "New pages..."
msgstr "新しいページ..."

#. TRANSLATORS: (the keyboard shortcuts lists, about 1100 px at 44 px in bold) Ctrl+S: the open page and
