#. TRANSLATORS: notices when Grimoire opens from KOReader's "Annotate this page in Grimoire"
#. and that page cannot be opened, in a toast: one line of about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or
#. two. This one: the picture of the page KOReader sent is damaged or missing.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Could not open the page KOReader sent: its picture does not read."
msgstr "KOReader が送信したページを開けませんでした。画像が読み取れません。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (as above) the page could not be added to its notebook: a file could not be
#. written.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Could not add the page KOReader sent. Is the storage full?"
msgstr ""
"KOReader が送信したページを追加できませんでした。ストレージがいっぱいですか?"

#. TRANSLATORS: (as above) any other reason; %s is the log file that says why.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Could not open the page KOReader sent (see %s)."
msgstr "KOReader が送信したページを開けませんでした (%s を参照)。"

#. TRANSLATORS: notices when Grimoire opens from KOReader's "Open this book in Grimoire", in a
#. toast: one line of about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two. This one: the book has more pages
#. than a notebook holds; %d is that number (2000).
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "The book has more pages than a notebook holds (%d)."
msgstr "この本にはノートに収まるページよりも多くのページがあります (%d)。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (as above) a page picture KOReader made is damaged or missing.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Could not open the book KOReader sent: a page's picture does not read."
msgstr "KOReader が送った本を開けませんでした。ページの画像が読み取れません。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (as above) the pages could not be added: a file could not be written.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Could not add the book's pages. Is the storage full?"
msgstr "本のページを追加できませんでした。ストレージがいっぱいですか?"

#. TRANSLATORS: (as above) any other reason; %s is the log file that says why.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Could not open the book KOReader sent (see %s)."
msgstr "KOReader が送信した本を開けませんでした (%s を参照)。"

#. TRANSLATORS: in a toast, once the pages of a book KOReader sent are in its notebook.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Added %d page of the book."
msgid_plural "Added %d pages of the book."
msgstr[0] "本の%dページを追加しました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: in a toast while Grimoire puts the pages of a book KOReader sent into its
#. notebook (a few seconds for a big book): pages done, of how many. One line of about 1700 px.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Adding the book's pages: %d of %d"
msgstr "本のページの追加: %d の %d"

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast at the start after an update KPM could not install (Settings > Updates).
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "The last update did not install. grimoire.log says why."
msgstr ""
"最後のアップデートはインストールされませんでした。 grimoire.log がその理由を"
"語ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: notices at startup, in a toast: one line of about 1700 px at 44 px in bold,
#. or two. "Kindle Settings" is the Kindle's own Settings, as its menus name them.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Your Kindle passcode was left off. Turn it back on in Kindle Settings."
msgstr "Kindle パスコードがオフのままです。 Kindle 設定で再度オンにします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the app's name, Grimoire.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "No pen found. %s is made for the Kindle Scribe; writing needs its pen."
msgstr ""
"ペンが見つかりません。 %s は Kindle Scribe 用に作られています。書くにはペンが"
"必要です。"

#. TRANSLATORS: toasts (one line of about 1700 px at 44 px in bold) when a controller, keyboard
#. or page turner comes or goes. "Held by another app": another program (a button mapper)
#. takes its presses, so Grimoire gets none.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Controller disconnected"
msgstr "コントローラーが切断されました"

#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Controller held by another app"
msgstr "別のアプリが保持しているコントローラー"

#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Controller connected"
msgstr "コントローラーが接続されています"

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast: Live view could not start (no memory for its copy of the screen,
#. or the server's port is taken).
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Could not start Live view"
msgstr "ライブビューを開始できませんでした"

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast as Live view stops (the Stop button on its card).
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Live view ended."
msgstr "ライブビューが終了しました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast: Live view turned itself off after 10 minutes with nobody watching.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Live view turned off: no one watched for 10 minutes."
msgstr "ライブビューがオフになりました。10 分間誰も視聴しませんでした。"

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast as the first computer starts watching the screen (Live view).
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "A computer is watching this screen."
msgstr "コンピューターがこの画面を見ています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: holding the power button 4 s leaves Grimoire, but this page could not be
#. saved (a full storage), so it stays once.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Could not save this page. Hold power 4 s again to leave anyway."
msgstr ""
"このページを保存できませんでした。とにかく終了するには、もう一度電源を 4 秒押"
"し続けます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: the last notice before Grimoire closes, with the page saved, or without it;
#. %s is the app's name, Grimoire.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Saved. Leaving %s."
msgstr "保存されました。 %sを出発します。"

#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Leaving %s without this page."
msgstr "このページを表示せずに %s を終了します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: the last notice before Grimoire closes for an update (Settings > Updates): KPM
#. installs it, then Grimoire starts again; or, opened from KOReader, KOReader comes back and
#. opens the new one next time.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Updating. Open Grimoire from KOReader again in a moment."
msgstr "更新中。すぐに KOReader から Grimoire を再度開きます。"

#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Updating. Grimoire starts again by itself."
msgstr "更新中。 Grimoire が自動的に再起動します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: a folder of page pictures (grimoire/import/<name>) became a new notebook.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Imported a notebook of %d page."
msgid_plural "Imported a notebook of %d pages."
msgstr[0] "%dページのノートブックをインポートしました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: a folder of page pictures could not become a notebook; %s is the log file
#. that says why. The folder stays where it was.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "Could not import a folder of pages (see %s)."
msgstr "ページのフォルダーをインポートできませんでした (%s を参照)。"

#. TRANSLATORS: a toast (about 1700 px at 44 px in bold, or two lines) once, at the first start of a new
#. version, when shortcuts.ini was the starter map an earlier version wrote (nobody had edited it): it has
#. this version's keys now.
#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts: the new starter keys are in shortcuts.ini."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: a PDF saved in the background, and where (the Kindle's folder of them).
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "PDF saved to %s"
msgstr "PDF が %s に保存されました"

#: rust/src/app.rs
msgid "Could not save the PDF"
msgstr "PDFを保存できませんでした"

#. TRANSLATORS: a page that could not be read; %s is the log file that says which.
#: rust/src/app.rs
#, c-format
msgid "A damaged page was set aside; a blank one took its place (see %s)"
msgstr ""
"破損したページは脇に置かれていました。空のものが代わりに使用されました (%s を"
"参照)"

#: rust/src/app.rs rust/src/library.rs
msgid "Could not save shortcuts.ini"
msgstr "shortcuts.iniを保存できませんでした"

#. TRANSLATORS: light action before its cached level is known; toast, 1700 px at 44 px.
#: rust/src/app.rs
